      "body": "since all RTX 50-series GPUs share the same sm_120 Blackwell architecture (RTX 5060 Ti, 5070, 5080, 5090, etc.), would it be better to use RTX 50-series or RTX 50xx instead of singling out RTX 5090? This way all consumer Blackwell users can immediately recognize the note applies to them.",
